{"suttaId":"tha-ap300","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[8996,9008],"vripara":"36"},"segments":{"tha-ap300:0.3":"Saraṇagamaniyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap300:1.1":"“Pabbate himavantamhi, ahosiṃ luddako tadā;","tha-ap300:1.3":"Vipassiṃ addasaṃ buddhaṃ, lokajeṭṭhaṃ narāsabhaṃ.","tha-ap300:2.1":"“Upāsitvāna sambuddhaṃ, veyyāvaccamakāsahaṃ;","tha-ap300:2.3":"Saraṇañca upāgacchiṃ, dvipadindassa tādino.","tha-ap300:3.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, saraṇaṃ upagacchahaṃ;","tha-ap300:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, saraṇāgamanapphalaṃ.","tha-ap300:4.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap300:5.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā saraṇagamaniyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap300:6.1":"Saraṇagamaniyattherassāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
